01:38:45.900 --> 01:38:48.770
Patient not in waiting for
someone to change their mind

01:38:48.770 --> 01:38:53.420
but just to still be loving.

01:38:53.420 --> 01:38:55.959
He was still very loving to us even though

01:38:55.959 --> 01:38:57.360
it had to have been written

01:38:57.360 --> 01:38:59.490
all over every everything we said

01:38:59.490 --> 01:39:01.780
and our faces, you know.

01:39:01.780 --> 01:39:02.963
Yeah, for sure.

01:39:04.230 --> 01:39:05.440
Do you--

01:39:05.440 --> 01:39:06.280
We should wrap things up.

01:39:06.280 --> 01:39:08.713
Okay, I think my last,

01:39:09.580 --> 01:39:12.200
in a desire to put a bow on something

01:39:13.500 --> 01:39:17.410
are you happy with the label
that you've given yourself

01:39:17.410 --> 01:39:19.320
of hopeful agnostic?

01:39:19.320 --> 01:39:24.070
I mean is that, are you happy with that?

01:39:24.070 --> 01:39:26.990
I don't know how to answer
if I'm happy with it.

01:39:26.990 --> 01:39:28.140
I mean you just who

01:39:28.140 --> 01:39:29.390
It's just where I'm at.

01:39:30.522 --> 01:39:31.843
I am happy.

01:39:33.462 --> 01:39:34.379
I am happy.

01:39:35.260 --> 01:39:37.793
Is it a destination I guess is?

01:39:38.810 --> 01:39:43.810
For me, I am open to revelation from God.

01:39:45.490 --> 01:39:46.323
like I haven't lot

01:39:46.323 --> 01:39:47.157
it's like listen, there's some things

01:39:47.157 --> 01:39:48.920
Should I step back?

01:39:48.920 --> 01:39:51.810
There's some things that I am

01:39:51.810 --> 01:39:54.130
I don't think I'll ever believe again.

01:39:54.130 --> 01:39:55.910
Like I'm not ever gonna believe

01:39:57.290 --> 01:39:59.260
that the earth is 10,000 years old,

01:39:59.260 --> 01:40:04.260
like that car left the
garage a long time ago.

01:40:07.483 --> 01:40:09.800
I don't think I can have a worldview

01:40:09.800 --> 01:40:14.800
that doesn't embrace the
reality of evolution,

01:40:14.930 --> 01:40:17.640
that every living being on the earth

01:40:17.640 --> 01:40:20.300
is related to every
living being on the earth.

01:40:20.300 --> 01:40:22.120
And I actually think that's beautiful

01:40:22.120 --> 01:40:25.833
even from the perspective
of there might be a creator.

01:40:28.711 --> 01:40:32.230
And I know that I could go into the desert

01:40:32.230 --> 01:40:33.840
or I can go into the office

01:40:33.840 --> 01:40:36.500
and have a crazy religious experience

01:40:36.500 --> 01:40:37.700
that all of a sudden I come back

01:40:37.700 --> 01:40:41.043
and I'm like I got something for you.

01:40:42.480 --> 01:40:44.258
And I'm not closing myself off to that.

01:40:44.258 --> 01:40:47.750
I'm not some pure Naturalist

01:40:47.750 --> 01:40:51.190
because listen, if anything that

01:40:51.190 --> 01:40:53.470
if my story represents anything

01:40:53.470 --> 01:40:55.370
is that I'm willing to change my mind.

01:40:58.820 --> 01:41:03.163
I had a faith that was so solid.

01:41:06.910 --> 01:41:10.370
This was so deep, this wasn't
the Sunday morning thing man,

01:41:10.370 --> 01:41:11.993
this was a lifestyle.

01:41:13.260 --> 01:41:17.520
This was in my blood and I let it go

01:41:18.783 --> 01:41:21.173
because I did not believe it to be true.

01:41:24.690 --> 01:41:29.113
I'm gonna follow truth
wherever it leads without fear,

01:41:30.330 --> 01:41:32.833
without fear of uncomfortable conclusions.

01:41:34.480 --> 01:41:37.390
And if that means that
oh and you know what,

01:41:37.390 --> 01:41:40.920
you're gonna have an encounter with God

01:41:40.920 --> 01:41:44.050
that is going to send
you to some new place

01:41:44.050 --> 01:41:47.573
or send you all the way
back, then so be it.

01:41:49.720 --> 01:41:52.930
But the thing I don't wanna
do is I don't want to...

01:41:52.930 --> 01:41:57.930
I feel like the curiosity and the openness

01:41:58.080 --> 01:41:59.900
that characterizes my life right now

01:41:59.900 --> 01:42:01.963
is something I don't wanna let go of.

01:42:03.450 --> 01:42:07.120
And I don't wanna be, in fact
quote from Ravi Zacharias,

01:42:07.120 --> 01:42:09.370
that I used to say, I'm
gonna butcher the quote,

01:42:09.370 --> 01:42:12.330
but he essentially talked
about you know being,

01:42:12.330 --> 01:42:14.040
you don't wanna be so open-minded

01:42:14.040 --> 01:42:17.683
that your mind is like a sewer
just letting everything in.

01:42:19.080 --> 01:42:21.790
Eventually, you gotta
bite down on something.

01:42:21.790 --> 01:42:24.260
So I recognize that you
just can't be passive

01:42:24.260 --> 01:42:27.980
but actually, I don't know.

01:42:27.980 --> 01:42:31.570
I have had some experiences
and come to some conclusions

01:42:31.570 --> 01:42:34.143
but I'm not ready to share
all that at this point.

01:42:35.870 --> 01:42:37.670
But I would say that, if anything,

01:42:37.670 --> 01:42:39.810
it's just sort of confirmed

01:42:39.810 --> 01:42:41.510
the direction that I've been going

01:42:42.770 --> 01:42:46.433
kind of away from the
faith of my childhood.

01:42:49.067 --> 01:42:50.393
That's my story.

01:42:52.180 --> 01:42:53.680
Thank you for sharing.

